# Shell launchers MUST keep LF endings: a CRLF checkout makes bash fail on
# macOS/Linux with "$'\r': command not found". The repo is developed on
# Windows (autocrlf), so pin these explicitly.
*.command text eol=lf
# Windows cmd.exe expects CRLF batch files; LF works in modern builds but
# breaks `choice` prompts and old cmd goto-scanning. Pin the opposite way for .bat.
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.sh       text eol=lf
